1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,118
January fifteenth, nineteen nineteen.

2
00:00:03,186 --> 00:00:04,427
Boston, Massachusetts.

3
00:00:04,714 --> 00:00:07,555
A tank holding two point three million gallons of

4
00:00:07,477 --> 00:00:08,718
molasses...

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,664
exploded.

6
00:00:09,805 --> 00:00:12,791
A wave — forty feet high, moving at thirty-five

7
00:00:12,786 --> 00:00:14,973
miles per hour — tore through the streets of

8
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:15,809
the North End.

9
00:00:15,841 --> 00:00:17,155
It crushed buildings.

10
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,391
It swallowed horses.

11
00:00:18,532 --> 00:00:21,300
It trapped people in a thick, suffocating flood.

12
00:00:21,586 --> 00:00:23,445
Twenty-one people died that day.

13
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:24,536
Not from water.

14
00:00:24,568 --> 00:00:25,664
Not from fire.

15
00:00:25,732 --> 00:00:27,009
From molasses.

16
00:00:27,114 --> 00:00:29,155
This is the story they don’t teach you in

17
00:00:29,077 --> 00:00:29,809
school.

